  "details": "When the master leaves a world, the next assigned master will receive a blast of messages that mention transferring ownership of objects. The issue is this is occurring for seemingly every udon object in the world, even unsynched ones, and causes a massive log spam due to this. Tested on live as of this bug report made, go to pretty much any world with udon scripts in them with 2 clients. Have the master leave, and have the newly assigned master looking at the logs, and you will see them spammed with these messages. Im unsure if this goes beyond just the logging phase.",
